      "notes": "Holds the iteration 8 geometry (best score 668) unchanged, so the next race isolates a controller change. Iteration 8 showed oval 20/20 with max_error 0.0165, s-bend 19/20, and slalom progress up to 0.34, but slalom still has 0 finishes at its floor, which indicates geometry is near its limit."
    }
  }
